---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';

/*
  Parked 2026-09-14 (research/site-audit-2026-09-14.md, "/units/"). The page used to be the
  founding brief's unit paragraph, which his son traced on 2026-09-13 to his own mishearing,
  and the unit's name and number are questions still to be asked cold. Until his service
  records come back, this page makes no claim about his unit: no name, number, size, trade
  or association. Do not rebuild it from the brief or from research/units/.
*/
---

<BaseLayout title="Units">
  <h1>Units</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    This page will return when Larry's service records come back.
  </p>
  <p>
    Until then, what he remembers about the men he served with is with the
    <a href={withBase('/photos/')}>photographs</a>, in his own words.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
</style>
